<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="クロノスタシス"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="BUMP OF CHICKEN"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Iris"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1617254912"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><songwriters><songwriter>藤原基央</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="5:04.135"><div begin="16.242" end="5:04.135"><p begin="16.242" end="20.006" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="16.242" end="17.519">もう一度</span><span begin="17.519" end="18.554">ドアを</span><span begin="18.554" end="19.253">开ける</span><span begin="19.253" end="20.006">まで</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再次打开那扇门之前</span></p><p begin="20.015" end="25.735" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="20.015" end="21.072">ノルマで</span><span begin="21.072" end="22.550">生き延びた</span><span begin="22.550" end="23.153">だけの</span><span begin="23.153" end="23.785">ような</span><span begin="24.964" end="25.735">今日を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我将得过且过的过每一天</span></p><p begin="25.743" end="30.047" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.743" end="26.764">読まない</span><span begin="26.764" end="27.873">手纸み</span><span begin="28.018" end="28.707">たいに</span><span begin="28.988" end="30.047">重ねて</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像不再阅读的信件一样堆叠</span></p><p begin="30.058" end="31.889" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="30.058" end="30.559">また</span><span begin="30.559" end="31.306">部屋を</span><span begin="31.306" end="31.889">出る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">又一次走出房间</span></p><p begin="32.252" end="36.063" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.252" end="33.255">明け方</span> <span begin="33.255" end="34.051">多分</span><span begin="34.051" end="34.730">梦を</span><span begin="34.730" end="35.500">见てい</span><span begin="35.500" end="36.063">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">黎明时分 好像做了个梦</span></p><p begin="36.071" end="40.043" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.071" end="37.066">思い</span><span begin="37.066" end="38.002">出そう</span><span begin="38.002" end="38.461">とは</span><span begin="38.461" end="39.492">しなかっ</span><span begin="39.492" end="40.043">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我却并未试图回忆</span></p><p begin="41.020" end="44.996" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="41.020" end="41.511">懐</span><span begin="41.511" end="42.511">かしさが</span><span begin="42.511" end="43.511">足迹</span><span begin="43.511" end="43.860">み</span><span begin="44.023" end="44.996">たいに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为有那宛如足迹的怀念感</span></p><p begin="45.005" end="49.505" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.005" end="45.761">证拠</span><span begin="45.761" end="46.558">として</span><span begin="46.710" end="47.908">残って</span><span begin="47.948" end="48.266">いた</span><span begin="48.266" end="48.816">か</span><span begin="48.816" end="49.505">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">作为证据留在心中</span></p><p begin="49.516" end="51.052" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.516" end="51.052">大通り</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">走上大街</span></p><p begin="51.581" end="57.105" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.581" end="52.801">谁かの</span><span begin="53.585" end="54.005">落と</span><span begin="54.005" end="54.934">した</span><span begin="54.989" end="56.277">约束</span><span begin="56.277" end="57.105">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从不知何人遗落的约定之上</span></p><p begin="57.510" end="1:01.571" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.510" end="58.521">跨</span><span begin="58.521" end="59.858">がれてい</span><span begin="59.858" end="1:01.571">く</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">跨步而过</span></p><p begin="1:03.984" end="1:08.007" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.984" end="1:04.568">この</span><span begin="1:04.568" end="1:05.606">街は</span><span begin="1:05.606" end="1:06.024">居场</span><span begin="1:06.024" end="1:06.452">所を</span><span begin="1:06.452" end="1:07.152">隠</span><span begin="1:07.152" end="1:07.610">してい</span><span begin="1:07.610" end="1:08.007">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这座城市将我的归处隐匿</span></p><p begin="1:08.016" end="1:12.061" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.016" end="1:09.025">仲间</span><span begin="1:09.027" end="1:10.358">外れ达</span><span begin="1:10.358" end="1:10.525">の</span><span begin="1:10.525" end="1:11.252">行</span><span begin="1:11.252" end="1:12.061">列</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在受排挤之人的队列中</span></p><p begin="1:12.283" end="1:16.279" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:12.283" end="1:13.151">并んだ</span><span begin="1:13.151" end="1:14.067">ままで</span><span begin="1:14.480" end="1:15.062">待つ</span><span begin="1:15.062" end="1:16.279">答えで</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要如何用那排队等待的答案</span></p><p begin="1:16.532" end="1:20.019" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:16.532" end="1:18.025">仆は仆を</span> <span begin="1:18.025" end="1:18.473">どう</span><span begin="1:18.473" end="1:19.255">救</span><span begin="1:19.255" end="1:20.019">える</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来将自己拯救</span></p><p begin="1:20.027" end="1:23.967" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:20.027" end="1:21.512">饰られた</span><span begin="1:21.512" end="1:22.252">古い</span><span begin="1:22.252" end="1:23.147">絵画の</span><span begin="1:23.147" end="1:23.967">ように</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那秒针停滞的记忆</span></p><p begin="1:24.078" end="1:28.022" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.078" end="1:25.258">秒针の</span><span begin="1:25.258" end="1:26.310">止まった</span><span begin="1:26.310" end="1:27.220">记忆の</span><span begin="1:27.220" end="1:28.022">中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如墙上的旧画作一般</span></p><p begin="1:28.030" end="1:32.217" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:28.030" end="1:29.276">何回も</span><span begin="1:29.276" end="1:30.050">闻いた</span> <span begin="1:30.250" end="1:30.904">君</span><span begin="1:31.000" end="1:32.217">の声が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">从中传出你那熟悉的声音</span></p><p begin="1:32.226" end="1:38.157" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:32.226" end="1:33.749">しまっていた</span><span begin="1:33.749" end="1:34.817">言叶を</span> <span begin="1:34.817" end="1:35.039">ま</span><span begin="1:35.039" end="1:35.587">だ</span> <span begin="1:35.951" end="1:37.054">探し</span><span begin="1:37.054" end="1:37.395">てい</span><span begin="1:37.395" end="1:38.157">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">依然在寻找那尘封的话语</span></p><p begin="1:44.086" end="1:47.972" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.086" end="1:44.982">ビルボー</span><span begin="1:44.982" end="1:45.872">ドの上</span> <span begin="1:45.982" end="1:46.782">云の</span><span begin="1:46.782" end="1:47.972">隙间に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">楼顶招牌上空 云朵缝隙之间</span></p><p begin="1:47.981" end="1:51.968" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:47.981" end="1:48.966">小さな</span><span begin="1:48.966" end="1:49.584">点</span><span begin="1:49.584" end="1:50.467">灭を</span><span begin="1:50.467" end="1:51.968">见送った</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那闪烁的微光 在我的目送下离去</span></p><p begin="1:53.019" end="1:57.007" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:53.019" end="1:54.619">ここにいると</span><span begin="1:54.619" end="1:55.375">教える</span><span begin="1:55.375" end="1:55.839">み</span><span begin="1:56.011" end="1:57.007">たいに</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就像在显示自己的位置一般</span></p><p begin="1:57.017" end="2:00.229" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:57.017" end="1:58.507">远くなって</span><span begin="1:58.507" end="1:59.537">消えていっ</span><span begin="1:59.537" end="2:00.229">た</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渐渐远去 消失不见</span></p><p begin="2:00.238" end="2:03.983" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.238" end="2:01.059">不意を</span><span begin="2:01.237" end="2:01.453">突</span><span begin="2:01.453" end="2:02.010">か</span><span begin="2:02.010" end="2:02.524">れて</span><span begin="2:02.524" end="2:03.304">思い</span><span begin="2:03.304" end="2:03.983">出す</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">忽然灵光一现</span></p><p begin="2:03.995" end="2:08.041" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.995" end="2:05.080">些细な</span><span begin="2:05.080" end="2:05.995">偶然</span><span begin="2:05.995" end="2:06.494">だけ</span> <span begin="2:06.494" end="2:07.275">键に</span><span begin="2:07.275" end="2:08.041">して</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将琐碎的巧合作为钥匙</span></p><p begin="2:09.008" end="2:13.031" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.008" end="2:10.248">どこか似た</span><span begin="2:10.248" end="2:11.008">くしゃみ</span> <span begin="2:11.008" end="2:11.795">闻いた</span><span begin="2:11.981" end="2:13.031">だとか</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">听到熟悉的喷嚏声 闻到熟悉的气味</span></p><p begin="2:13.039" end="2:17.377" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:13.039" end="2:14.058">匂いが</span><span begin="2:14.252" end="2:14.733">した</span> <span begin="2:14.937" end="2:15.547">その</span><span begin="2:15.547" end="2:16.323">程</span><span begin="2:16.323" end="2:16.683">度</span><span begin="2:16.683" end="2:17.377">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">诸如此类</span></p><p begin="2:17.484" end="2:21.207" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:17.484" end="2:18.846">臆病で</span><span begin="2:19.440" end="2:20.516">狡いか</span><span begin="2:20.516" end="2:21.207">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我胆小而狡猾</span></p><p begin="2:21.581" end="2:24.940" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.581" end="2:22.942">忘れた</span><span begin="2:22.972" end="2:23.843">ふりを</span><span begin="2:24.015" end="2:24.523">しな</span><span begin="2:24.523" end="2:24.940">きゃ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果不假装忘记</span></p><p begin="2:25.523" end="2:28.919" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:25.523" end="2:27.225">逃げ出し</span><span begin="2:27.225" end="2:27.787">そう</span><span begin="2:27.787" end="2:28.919">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就可能落荒而逃</span></p><p begin="2:32.035" end="2:36.009" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:32.035" end="2:33.294">例えば</span><span begin="2:33.294" end="2:33.973">未来</span> <span begin="2:33.975" end="2:35.518">変えられるよう</span><span begin="2:35.518" end="2:36.009">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我无意改变未来</span></p><p begin="2:36.019" end="2:40.099" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:36.019" end="2:36.950">大そ</span><span begin="2:36.950" end="2:37.509">れた</span><span begin="2:37.515" end="2:38.529">力</span><span begin="2:38.529" end="2:39.462">じゃなくて</span><span begin="2:39.462" end="2:40.099">いい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不需要夸张的神力</span></p><p begin="2:40.276" end="2:44.281" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:40.276" end="2:40.849">君</span><span begin="2:40.957" end="2:42.019">のいない</span> <span begin="2:42.251" end="2:42.889">世界</span><span begin="2:42.985" end="2:43.788">の中</span><span begin="2:43.788" end="2:44.281">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想在这个没有你的世界中</span></p><p begin="2:44.490" end="2:48.108" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:44.490" end="2:45.712">息をする</span><span begin="2:45.712" end="2:46.758">理由に</span><span begin="2:46.758" end="2:48.108">応えたい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回答呼吸的理由</span></p><p begin="2:48.118" end="2:52.068" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:48.118" end="2:48.963">仆の</span><span begin="2:48.963" end="2:49.536">奥</span> <span begin="2:49.536" end="2:50.545">残った</span><span begin="2:50.545" end="2:51.033">ひと</span><span begin="2:51.033" end="2:52.068">欠片</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我内心深处留有一块碎片</span></p><p begin="2:52.077" end="2:56.041" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:52.077" end="2:53.043">时计</span><span begin="2:53.043" end="2:53.565">にも</span><span begin="2:53.565" end="2:54.295">消せ</span><span begin="2:54.295" end="2:55.295">なかった</span><span begin="2:55.295" end="2:56.041">もの</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连时间都未能将其抹去</span></p><p begin="2:56.049" end="3:00.300" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:56.049" end="2:56.421">枯</span><span begin="2:56.526" end="2:58.025">れた喉を</span> <span begin="2:58.297" end="2:58.838">振り</span><span begin="2:58.990" end="3:00.300">绞って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那其中一定存有</span></p><p begin="3:00.309" end="3:06.351" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:00.309" end="3:01.047">いつか</span><span begin="3:01.047" end="3:01.693">君に</span><span begin="3:01.693" end="3:02.817">伝えたい</span><span begin="3:02.817" end="3:03.249">こと</span><span begin="3:03.249" end="3:03.699">が</span><span begin="3:04.022" end="3:04.488">ある</span><span begin="3:04.488" end="3:06.351">だろう</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我即使声嘶力竭 也要向你传达之事</span></p><p begin="3:06.561" end="3:11.429" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:06.561" end="3:07.717">それっぽい</span><span begin="3:07.717" end="3:08.746">台词で</span><span begin="3:08.766" end="3:09.826">误魔化</span><span begin="3:09.826" end="3:11.429">した</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用套话蒙混过关</span></p><p begin="3:14.498" end="3:19.325" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:14.498" end="3:15.794">必要に</span><span begin="3:15.794" end="3:16.804">応じて</span><span begin="3:16.807" end="3:17.509">笑っ</span><span begin="3:17.509" end="3:17.891">たり</span><span begin="3:17.891" end="3:19.325">した</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">用赔笑敷衍了事</span></p><p begin="3:22.049" end="3:29.502" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:22.049" end="3:23.777">拾わなかった</span><span begin="3:23.777" end="3:24.782">瞬间</span><span begin="3:24.782" end="3:25.636">ばかり</span> <span begin="3:26.283" end="3:27.350">どうして</span><span begin="3:27.491" end="3:28.785">こんな</span><span begin="3:28.785" end="3:29.502">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为何那些从未在意过的瞬间</span></p><p begin="3:29.512" end="3:35.602" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:29.512" end="3:30.990">今更</span><span begin="3:31.349" end="3:32.029">いち</span><span begin="3:32.262" end="3:33.040">いち</span><span begin="3:33.296" end="3:35.602">眩しい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今会如此刺眼</span></p><p begin="3:54.003" end="3:58.008" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:54.003" end="3:54.499">この</span><span begin="3:54.499" end="3:55.588">街は</span><span begin="3:55.588" end="3:55.998">居场</span><span begin="3:55.998" end="3:56.517">所を</span><span begin="3:56.517" end="3:57.126">隠</span><span begin="3:57.126" end="3:57.563">してい</span><span begin="3:57.563" end="3:58.008">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这座城市将我的归处隐匿</span></p><p begin="3:58.017" end="4:02.062" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3:58.017" end="3:59.026">仲间</span><span begin="3:59.028" end="4:00.359">外れ达</span><span begin="4:00.359" end="4:00.526">の</span><span begin="4:00.526" end="4:01.253">行</span><span begin="4:01.253" end="4:02.062">列</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我在受排挤之人的队列中</span></p><p begin="4:02.283" end="4:06.279" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:02.283" end="4:03.151">并んだ</span><span begin="4:03.151" end="4:04.067">ままで</span><span begin="4:04.480" end="4:05.062">待つ</span><span begin="4:05.062" end="4:06.279">答えで</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我要如何用那排队等待的答案</span></p><p begin="4:06.474" end="4:09.961" itunes:key="L46" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:06.474" end="4:08.087">仆は仆を</span> <span begin="4:08.087" end="4:08.510">どう</span><span begin="4:08.510" end="4:09.291">救</span><span begin="4:09.291" end="4:09.961">える</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">来将自己拯救</span></p><p begin="4:10.061" end="4:14.011" itunes:key="L47" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:10.061" end="4:10.906">仆の</span><span begin="4:10.906" end="4:11.479">奥</span> <span begin="4:11.479" end="4:12.488">残った</span><span begin="4:12.488" end="4:12.976">ひと</span><span begin="4:12.976" end="4:14.011">欠片</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我内心深处留有一块碎片</span></p><p begin="4:14.057" end="4:18.021" itunes:key="L48" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:14.057" end="4:15.023">时计</span><span begin="4:15.023" end="4:15.545">にも</span><span begin="4:15.545" end="4:16.275">消せ</span><span begin="4:16.275" end="4:17.275">なかった</span><span begin="4:17.275" end="4:18.021">もの</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连时间都未能将其抹去</span></p><p begin="4:18.096" end="4:22.347" itunes:key="L49" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:18.096" end="4:18.468">枯</span><span begin="4:18.573" end="4:20.072">れた喉を</span> <span begin="4:20.344" end="4:20.885">振り</span><span begin="4:21.037" end="4:22.347">绞って</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那是我即使声嘶力竭</span></p><p begin="4:22.252" end="4:26.022" itunes:key="L50" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:22.252" end="4:23.095">いつか</span><span begin="4:23.095" end="4:23.697">君に</span><span begin="4:23.697" end="4:24.787">伝えたい</span><span begin="4:24.787" end="4:25.256">こと</span><span begin="4:25.256" end="4:26.022">が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也要向你传达之事</span></p><p begin="4:26.031" end="4:30.033" itunes:key="L51" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:26.031" end="4:26.528">失く</span><span begin="4:26.528" end="4:27.032">し</span><span begin="4:27.034" end="4:27.526">たく</span><span begin="4:27.526" end="4:27.996">ない</span><span begin="4:28.055" end="4:28.733">ものが</span><span begin="4:28.733" end="4:29.298">あっ</span><span begin="4:29.298" end="4:30.033">たよ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我有不想失去之物</span></p><p begin="4:30.040" end="4:33.980" itunes:key="L52" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:30.040" end="4:31.041">帰り</span><span begin="4:31.041" end="4:31.486">たい</span><span begin="4:31.486" end="4:32.050">场所</span><span begin="4:32.050" end="4:32.885">だって</span><span begin="4:32.885" end="4:33.293">あっ</span><span begin="4:33.293" end="4:33.980">たよ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我有想要归去之处</span></p><p begin="4:34.291" end="4:38.296" itunes:key="L53" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:34.291" end="4:34.864">君</span><span begin="4:34.972" end="4:36.034">のいない</span> <span begin="4:36.266" end="4:36.904">世界</span><span begin="4:37.000" end="4:37.803">の中</span><span begin="4:37.803" end="4:38.296">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想在这个没有你的世界中</span></p><p begin="4:38.509" end="4:42.061" itunes:key="L54" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:38.509" end="4:39.066">君</span><span begin="4:39.066" end="4:39.809">といた</span><span begin="4:39.809" end="4:40.388">昨日</span><span begin="4:40.507" end="4:40.760">に</span><span begin="4:40.760" end="4:41.509">応え</span><span begin="4:41.509" end="4:42.061">たい</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">回应和你在一起的昨天</span></p><p begin="4:42.071" end="4:45.991" itunes:key="L55" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:42.071" end="4:43.530">饰られた</span><span begin="4:43.530" end="4:44.240">古い</span><span begin="4:44.240" end="4:45.166">絵画の</span><span begin="4:45.166" end="4:45.582">よう</span><span begin="4:45.582" end="4:45.991">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那秒针停滞的记忆</span></p><p begin="4:46.001" end="4:50.009" itunes:key="L56" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:46.001" end="4:47.347">秒针の</span><span begin="4:47.347" end="4:47.998">止まっ</span><span begin="4:47.998" end="4:48.311">た</span><span begin="4:48.313" end="4:49.290">记忆の</span><span begin="4:49.290" end="4:50.009">中</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如墙上的旧画作一般</span></p><p begin="4:50.017" end="4:54.253" itunes:key="L57" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:50.017" end="4:50.987">鲜明</span><span begin="4:50.987" end="4:51.787">に缲り</span><span begin="4:51.787" end="4:52.157">返す</span> <span begin="4:52.270" end="4:52.842">君</span><span begin="4:53.019" end="4:53.310">の</span><span begin="4:53.310" end="4:54.253">声が</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你的声音在其中清晰地回响</span></p><p begin="4:54.260" end="4:58.056" itunes:key="L58" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:54.260" end="4:55.282">运んで</span><span begin="4:55.282" end="4:55.742">きた</span><span begin="4:55.742" end="4:56.793">答えを</span> <span begin="4:56.793" end="4:57.056">ま</span><span begin="4:57.056" end="4:58.056">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如今我依然在寻找</span></p><p begin="4:58.065" end="5:04.135" itunes:key="L59" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:58.065" end="4:59.012">しまっ</span><span begin="4:59.012" end="4:59.789">ていた</span><span begin="4:59.789" end="5:00.906">言叶を</span> <span begin="5:00.906" end="5:01.602">今</span> <span begin="5:01.891" end="5:02.990">探し</span><span begin="5:02.990" end="5:03.316">てい</span><span begin="5:03.316" end="5:04.135">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你声音中的答案 和尘封的话语</span></p></div></body></tt>